  "description": "An unusual family or ideal family? Dangerous relationships within a family living under one roof. \n\n(Source: Mr. Blue, translated) \n\n1-5. **Eommaui Fan Letter** (엄마의 팬레터, Fan Letters From My Fake Mom) \\[Sa-Geum\\]\n6-10. **Ianhwanan** (이안환안(以眼還眼), An Eye for an Eye) \\[Geum-Bap\\]\n11-14. **Huiwon Ege** (희원(希願) 에게, Dear Heewon) \\[Max\\]\n15-21. **Dalmeun Pi** (닮은 피, Blood of a Kind) \\[I-Won Cha\\]\n22-26. **Yeongwonui Sajeong** (영원의 사정, Bonded for Eternity) \\[Hocco\\]\n27-31. **Hyeongjega Sumgin Bimil** (형제가 숨긴 비밀, The Brothers' Secret) \\[Man-Se Lee\\] \n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
